    VCC -->|5V Rail| LDR
    VCC -->|5V Rail| Servo

    LDR -->|Junction Node| A0
    LDR -->|Junction Node| R10K
    R10K --> GND

    D3 --> R_Res -->|Red Anode| LED
    D5 --> G_Res -->|Green Anode| LED
    D6 --> B_Res -->|Blue Anode| LED
